{"node_id": "nd006", "text": "To feel seen", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd005", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.8, "confidence_raw": 0.8, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000945-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "It's like they're missing all the other things about me. Makes me feel like I have to constantly prove myself. Feels frustrating and small.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 139}, {"session_id": "p000945-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 17, "quote": "I'm always having to fight to be seen for everything I am, not just one thing.", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 170}, {"session_id": "p000945-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 19, "quote": "Every day is a battle to remind people about all the other parts of me, not just this one thing.", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 117}, {"session_id": "p000945-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I've been okay, I guess. Just trying to stay busy.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 50}, {"session_id": "p000945-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Have you had any downtime today?", "char_start": 63, "char_end": 95}, {"session_id": "p000945-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "But sometimes, I just worry too much. Like, I overthink stuff.", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 90}, {"session_id": "p000945-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "But sometimes, it feels like people might judge me for my interests, you know? Like my favorite team isn't taken seriously.", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 144}, {"session_id": "p000945-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "Yeah, sharing can feel risky. I just worry they might not understand or think it's silly.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 89}, {"session_id": "p000945-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "It's hard to open up about it, but thanks for understanding. I guess I just want to feel like my interests matter.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 114}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261017T043012Z", "last_updated_at": "20261017T043405Z", "first_seen_session": "p000945-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000945-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 2}
